{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"七年春，夫人姜氏會齊侯于防。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"夏四月辛卯，夜，恆星不見。夜中，星隕如雨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"秋，大水。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"無麥、苗。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"冬，夫人姜氏會齊侯于穀。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"七年春，文姜會齊侯于防，齊志也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"夏，恆星不見，夜明也。星隕如雨，與雨偕也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_36_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_36","textTraditional":"秋，無麥、苗，不害嘉穀也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}